{
    "title": "OBD2 Car Scanner: Torque ELM",
    "description": "OBD2 Car Scanner ELM is a versatile tool that transforms your smartphone into a powerful diagnostic and performance analyzer for your vehicle. By connecting to your car's computer system (ECU) via a Wi-Fi or Bluetooth OBD2 adapter, this app offers a wealth of information and control.   \r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n- Real-time Performance Monitoring: Create custom dashboards with gauges and charts to track engine performance, fuel consumption, and other vital parameters.   \r\n- Hidden Vehicle Data: Access advanced information (extended PIDs) that car manufacturers typically withhold, providing deeper insights into your vehicle's health.   \r\n- Diagnostic Trouble Code (DTC) Management: Identify and reset error codes, similar to a professional scan tool, with a comprehensive DTC code database.   \r\n- Sensor Data Analysis: Monitor all vehicle sensors on a single screen for quick troubleshooting.   \r\n- Emissions Readiness Check: Determine if your car is ready for emissions testing.\r\n- ECU Self-Monitoring Test: Access and analyze ECU self-monitoring data to identify potential issues and save on repair costs.   \r\n- Wide Compatibility: Works with most vehicles built after 2000 (and some as early as 1996) and supports a variety of OBD2 adapters.   \r\n\r\nWe are compatible with almost car brand and OBD devices like: FixD OBD, Bluedriver OBD, Torque OBD, Torque Pro, Veepeak OBD, ELM 327, OBD Doctor, OBD Fusion, Carly OBD,..and more\r\n\r\nWhether you're a DIY enthusiast or simply want to optimize your vehicle's performance, OBD2 Car Scanner ELM provides the tools and information you need to keep your car running smoothly.\r\n\r\nNotice\r\n- This app are free-to-install, but has some premium features that need purchase/subscribe to use. Non-subscribed users can use each Premium feature for a limited number of times per day.\r\n- Subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled 24 hours before the end of the period.\r\n- Manage your subscription and turn off auto-renewal in your account settings.\r\n- Any unused portion of a free trial will be forfeited if you subscribe.\r\n\r\nTerm of use: https://moniqtap.com/terms-of-use/\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://moniqtap.com/privacy-policy/",
    "descriptionHTML": "OBD2 Car Scanner ELM is a versatile tool that transforms your smartphone into a powerful diagnostic and performance analyzer for your vehicle. By connecting to your car&#39;s computer system (ECU) via a Wi-Fi or Bluetooth OBD2 adapter, this app offers a wealth of information and control.   <br><br>Key Features:<br><br>- Real-time Performance Monitoring: Create custom dashboards with gauges and charts to track engine performance, fuel consumption, and other vital parameters.   <br>- Hidden Vehicle Data: Access advanced information (extended PIDs) that car manufacturers typically withhold, providing deeper insights into your vehicle&#39;s health.   <br>- Diagnostic Trouble Code (DTC) Management: Identify and reset error codes, similar to a professional scan tool, with a comprehensive DTC code database.   <br>- Sensor Data Analysis: Monitor all vehicle sensors on a single screen for quick troubleshooting.   <br>- Emissions Readiness Check: Determine if your car is ready for emissions testing.<br>- ECU Self-Monitoring Test: Access and analyze ECU self-monitoring data to identify potential issues and save on repair costs.   <br>- Wide Compatibility: Works with most vehicles built after 2000 (and some as early as 1996) and supports a variety of OBD2 adapters.   <br><br>We are compatible with almost car brand and OBD devices like: FixD OBD, Bluedriver OBD, Torque OBD, Torque Pro, Veepeak OBD, ELM 327, OBD Doctor, OBD Fusion, Carly OBD,..and more<br><br>Whether you&#39;re a DIY enthusiast or simply want to optimize your vehicle&#39;s performance, OBD2 Car Scanner ELM provides the tools and information you need to keep your car running smoothly.<br><br>Notice<br>- This app are free-to-install, but has some premium features that need purchase/subscribe to use. Non-subscribed users can use each Premium feature for a limited number of times per day.<br>- Subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled 24 hours before the end of the period.<br>- Manage your subscription and turn off auto-renewal in your account settings.<br>- Any unused portion of a free trial will be forfeited if you subscribe.<br><br>Term of use: https://moniqtap.com/terms-of-use/<br>Privacy Policy: https://moniqtap.com/privacy-policy/",
